-- Pricing lives on the server, not in the browser.
--
-- Every rate, every benchmark tier, and the freelancer-vs-boutique-vs-agency
-- comparison used to ship inside the site's JavaScript. No public page rendered
-- them, which is exactly why it went unnoticed — but any visitor could read the
-- whole price list, and the competitive positioning with it, straight out of
-- the source.
--
-- They live here now and reach the owner portal only after a successful login,
-- through the same token that guards the invoices. A change to a price takes
-- effect on the next portal load, with no redeploy.
insert into settings(key, value, updated_at)
